---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const pageTitle = "Website Privacy Policy | TrueBridge";
const description =
  "Learn how information may be collected and used when visiting the TrueBridge website.";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} {description}>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-canvas py-14 lg:py-20" aria-labelledby="wpp-hero-heading">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-5 text-left sm:px-6 lg:px-10">
        <h1
          id="wpp-hero-heading"
          class="mb-6 font-display text-5xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-ink md:text-6xl"
        >
          Website Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="max-w-[760px] text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-xl">
          This page explains how information may be collected and used when you visit the TrueBridge website. This policy is separate
          from our Notice of Privacy Practices.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-paper py-14 lg:py-20" aria-label="Website Privacy Policy details">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-10">
        <p class="mb-1 text-lg font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight text-ink">WEBSITE PRIVACY POLICY</p>
        <p class="mb-10 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-xl">Last updated: May 12, 2026</p>

        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          This Website Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected and used when you visit the TrueBridge website. This
          policy applies to general website use and is separate from our
          <a
            href="/notice-of-privacy-practices"
            class="font-medium text-sageDark underline decoration-sand underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-clay hover:decoration-clay"
            >Notice of Privacy Practices</a
          >, which describes how protected health information may be used and disclosed in connection with therapy services.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-0 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          1. Information you choose to provide
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          You may choose to contact TrueBridge by phone, email, scheduling tools, or other communication methods made available through
          the website. Information you provide may include your name, contact information, and the reason you are reaching out.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          Please do not include detailed clinical information, diagnosis information, trauma details, or urgent safety concerns in general
          email, voicemail, or non-secure contact messages.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          2. Website usage information
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          Like many websites, this site may collect basic technical or usage information, such as browser type, device information, pages
          visited, referring pages, and general interaction data. This information may be used to understand website performance, improve
          the site, and maintain security.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">3. Third-party tools</h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          The website may use third-party tools or embedded services for scheduling, contact requests, analytics, hosting, or similar
          website functions. These tools may process information according to their own privacy practices and applicable agreements.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          When a secure scheduling or contact tool is used, information submitted through that tool may be handled by the third-party service
          used for that purpose.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          4. Protected health information
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          This website is intended for general informational purposes and basic contact or scheduling access. Please do not submit detailed
          protected health information through general website contact methods unless you are using a secure, approved form or portal.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          For information about how health information may be used and disclosed in connection with therapy services, please review our
          <a
            href="/notice-of-privacy-practices"
            class="font-medium text-sageDark underline decoration-sand underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-clay hover:decoration-clay"
            >Notice of Privacy Practices</a
          >.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          5. Cookies and similar technologies
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          This website may use cookies or similar technologies to support site functionality, understand usage, or improve the visitor
          experience. You can adjust your browser settings to limit or block cookies, though some website features may not work as intended.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          6. Links to other websites
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          This website may link to third-party websites or services. TrueBridge is not responsible for the privacy practices, content, or
          security of external websites.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">7. Security</h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          We use reasonable efforts to protect information associated with the website. However, no website or electronic communication
          method can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">8. Children’s privacy</h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          This website is intended for general audiences and is not designed to knowingly collect personal information from children through
          general website use.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">9. Updates to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          This policy may be updated from time to time. The current version will be posted on this website.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">10. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          If you have questions about this Website Privacy Policy, please contact TrueBridge.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
